        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nYeah, I can see how this can be useful. And yes, it indeed was not included because `vimi.lsp.buf.code_action()` doesn't support `on_list` option which allows customizing behavior of how returned items are processed. All other scopes [rely on that](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/71b5694a2df4f7e3661855eb8e2814980d2e0ac9/doc/mini-extra.txt#L599-L601) and including one more with different implementation feels a bit too much.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
