            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Haha was just saying that I appreciate the open source work and how you take the time to address every doubt or issue, definitely the best nvim plugin out there.\r\n\r\n---\r\nHow would that work if I want to have it set to a custom mapping?\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n```lua\r\n    pick.registry.lsp_references = function()\r\n      extra.pickers.lsp({ scope = 'references' })\r\n    end\r\n    vim.keymap.set('n', ',r', pick.registry.lsp_references)\r\n```",
